# Tokens de diseño — IDCBIS

Referencia esencial. Detalle completo en `@.cursor/skills/web-design/idcbis-tokens.md`.

## Paleta institucional (sitio público)

| Token | Hex | Uso |
|-------|-----|-----|
| `brand-primary` | `#005674` | Links, focus, acentos, header gradient inicio |
| `brand-primary-dark` | `#003C5F` | Footer, hover botones |
| `brand-secondary` | `#008996` | Header gradient fin |
| `brand-deep` | `#0B4F6C` | Bloques idcbis, títulos |
| `brand-deep-alt` | `#003d52` | Gradientes hero |
| `brand-accent` | `#C4A140` | Acento dorado (stats, CTAs footer) |
| `accent-red` | `#d32f2f` | Donación / subrayados acordeón |
| `text-body` | `#1a1a1a` | Body |
| `text-muted` | `#607d8b` | Texto secundario |
| `surface-light` | `#eceff1` | Fondos suaves |
| `surface-page` | `#f8f9fa` / `bg-gray-50` | Layout |

**No** usar azul genérico (`#3b82f6`, `blue-500`) en UI pública nueva.

## Tipografía

| Rol | Variable | Familia | Peso |
|-----|----------|---------|------|
| Cuerpo | `--font-idcbis` | Museo Sans Condensed | 500 |
| Títulos | `--font-idcbis-display` | Museo Sans Condensed | 700–900 |

JS: `SITE_TYPOGRAPHY` / `fontFamily` desde `@/config/siteTypography`.

## Layout

- Contenedor estándar: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`
- Bloques idcbis full-bleed: max-width interno `1200px`–`1400px` centrado

## Estados interactivos

| Contexto | Patrón |
|----------|--------|
| Focus público | `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#005674]` |
| Focus admin | `dark:focus:ring-[#58a6ff]` |
| Hover link footer/acento | `hover:text-[#D9B85A]` sobre `#C4A140` |
| Spinner | `border-b-2 border-[#005674]` |

